WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Every call has six steps.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.200
Narrator: Think: what do I need to say?

3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.000
Narrator: Listen: is the channel clear - is anyone else talking?

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.100
Narrator: Press and hold the talk button.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.200
Narrator: Pause for one second, so your first word isn't cut off.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.400
Narrator: Speak slowly and clearly.

7
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.100
Narrator: Then release the button - nobody can answer you until you let go.

